  <metadata>
    <name>Sant Hilari &amp; Susqueda Dam Loop</name>
    <desc>Punchy Girona loop with 1,710m of climbing through quiet winding roads. Features a gradual 20km climb to Sant Hilari Sacalm, twisting forest descents, and the dramatic Susqueda dam and reservoir.</desc>
    <author><name>loops.ie</name></author>
    <time>2026-03-20T13:58:49.258Z</time>
  </metadata>
